what's going on guys this is rob and we  are back with another episode of our  beyond omega level series which we  forgot to do on friday so we're doing it  today and then we're doing another one  on friday so we're doing two in one week  to get us back on schedule and we have a  viewer suggestion from r evan w who said  that since we had done an episode on  zeus we needed to do one on nyx the  goddess of darkness so that's what we're  going to do here today so nyx was  created by al ewing jim zub mark wade  and joshua james shaw and first appeared  in avengers no road home in 2019. so  she's a relatively new character and  we've only seen her within the no road  home miniseries that was released weekly  in early 2019. but the series basically  opened with a character known as voyager  or vonnie gast who was a character that  was introduced in late 2018 as a  supposed lost avenger named valerie  vector who had been around since the  group's founding and had just everybody  just forgot about her to be quite honest  but as it turns out she was actually the  daughter of the grand master that was  placed on earth as his agent and it  implanted false memories in people's  minds to make it seem like she was this  famous superhero that had been forgotten  now eventually she turns on her father  and becomes an ally of the avengers and  as the no-road home mini-series begins  she's basically going around assembling  a team of avengers to deal with a threat  that's causing the whole world to go  dark so voyager rounds up a few avengers  for her team including hawkeye scarlet  witch vision spectrum and hulk before  she finally finds hercules and tells him  that his home mount olympus has been  attacked by this threat now voyager uses  her teleportation powers to open a  portal to olympus and hercules finds  most of the greek gods have basically  been slaughtered except for her sister  athena who is clinging to life and so  she tells hercules that the carnage he  sees is the work of the queen of the  night whose name he's not allowed to  utter now scarlet witch then explains  that according to greek myth the goddess  of the night is called nix which proves  to be a mistake not because the  information is incorrect but because  immediately after saying her name she  shows up and places her hand through  wanda's head which i always thought was  a really weird circumstance because you  would think that hercules would know  greek mythology better than wanda would  but we ultimately end up seeing a  flashback to what happened on mount  olympus which is that nyx had shown up  and talked about how mad she is that  zeus had locked her away and mocks the  greek gods because nobody worships them  anymore before she and her minions just  start wrecking the whole place now we  also learned that mix was freed from her  imprisonment when the earth was briefly  moved away from the sun during a game  between the grand master and the  challenger which voyager was also a part  of furthermore we learned that when he  imprisoned her zeus took three night  shards from nick's soul which is just  wild now while being tortured zeus  reveals that he gave one of the shards  to an ally in a place of knowledge one  to an enemy in a place of dreams and  place one in a far-off paradise now  after getting this information nyx  effortlessly snaps zeus's neck killing  him instantly and so when we consider  that zeus himself is beyond omega level  it stands to reason that if nyx is able  to kill him without breaking a sweat  that she would also be pretty far beyond  this guy now nyx then states to her  minions that with the gods out of the  way her plan is to wipe the universe  clean and start a new one which makes  sense right the greek gods are the ones  standing between just the end of all  things total oblivion but of course this  will require her to regain the shards  that zeus had hidden but what is  mind-blowing about this is that without  the shards nyx is at her weakest so she  was able to take out all the gods of  olympus at a mere fraction of her full  power and is also able to withstand a  combined attack from the avengers and  voyager without being significantly  harmed now it's at this point that nyx's  true origin was revealed and we learned  that she existed before there was light  and when more and more light came into  existence because of zeus it became  clear that the two of them could not  coexist now zeus then builds mount  olympus which becomes an immense source  of light chipping away at the darkness  and therefore at nyx's power now once  humans were given fire there was even  more light and nyx was weakened even  further and so as the olympians were  worshipped by humans nyx became angrier  and vowed to exact revenge on the gods  now when the inevitable fight between  nicks and the gods occurred the gods  banded together to defeat her and zeus  took the shards of her soul and  imprisoned her in darkness where she  grew angrier and angrier now when the  earth leaves the orbit of the sun and  nyx is ultimately freed she causes  darkness to fall over every light source  not only on earth but in the entire  universe now eventually nyx is able to  acquire two of three shards containing  her soul and makes her way to a planet  called euphoria which had been created  by the silver surfer and his companion  dawn greenwood to be inhabited by the  citizens of another planet which had  been destroyed now euphoria is a  sentient planet and had been given the  final shard by zeus and so a battle  raged between nyx and the avengers and  during this fight euphoria offered the  shard to nix willingly which returned  her to full power now with her godhood  restored nyx was able to see the center  of all reality the birthplace of all  that was all that is and all that ever  will be which really sounds like a bread  heart promo and the place from which she  will remake the universe a house in long  island new york  now it turns out the house is actually  the house of ideas which is the point  from which all marvel stories originate  and the house of ideas those you guys  who don't know is a nickname for marvel  comics that they actually had back in  the 60s and 70s when marvel was  revolutionizing superhero comics unlike  now so to incorporate it into an actual  story is pretty meta as is the way that  nyx is eventually defeated so before nyx  can rebuild the entire multiverse in her  image vision is able to breach the house  of ideas through a sliver of light that  remained as the door closed now once  inside he has a conversation with nyx  and explains that a universe cannot be  created out of darkness but requires  light because the imagination needed to  create a universe is synonymous with  life now vision then takes the form of  the human torch and burns next to ashes  but she proclaims that she will not be  gone forever and there will always be  darkness but up to this point that's all  we've seen of nyx although it is  possible she may return somewhere down  the road as far as her powers go  basically she can control darkness she  can summon darkness she can create  constructs made of shadow to basically  do her bidding and she can become a  shadow herself making herself intangible  she also has immense super human  physical attributes and can teleport  through time and space at will and while  we have only seen her in one series the  fact that she wiped out a pantheon of  gods while at her weakest without  breaking a sweat would be enough to call  her omega level but she was on the verge  of recreating reality and likely would  have succeeded if the writers hadn't  been set on making some sort of meta  commentary on imagination in life but  that being said guys we're gonna bring  this to an end thank you all for  watching and i will catch you all later  peace
 

